---
// HowItWorksIntro.astro — Encabezado de «Cómo funciona» (v3-premium)
---

<header class="hiw-header">
  <p class="hiw-kicker">CÓMO FUNCIONA</p>
  <h2 id="how-it-works-title" class="hiw-title">
    <span class="hiw-title-dark">Importas, pones la matrícula, emites.</span>{' '}
    <span class="hiw-title-muted">Así de corto es tu día.</span>
  </h2>
</header>

<style>
  .hiw-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .hiw-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #047857;
  }

  .hiw-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 56px;
    line-height: 1.03;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    font-weight: 700;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .hiw-title-dark {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  .hiw-title-muted {
    background: linear-gradient(0deg, #94A3B8, #94A3B8);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .hiw-title {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
  }
</style>
